---

---

<section id="features" class="relative py-24 px-6 overflow-hidden">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_center,rgba(99,102,241,0.02)_0%,transparent_70%)] pointer-events-none"></div>
  <div class="relative max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 md:mb-20">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500/10 border border-indigo-500/20 text-indigo-400 text-sm font-medium mb-6">
        Funcionalidades
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 tracking-tight">
        Todo lo que necesitas, <span class="gradient-text">en una app</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-gray-400 text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto">
        KnowYou aprende de ti para darte recomendaciones que realmente importan.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="group relative bg-gray-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-indigo-500/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-indigo-500/5">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-500/20 to-purple-500/20 border border-indigo-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:from-indigo-500/30 group-hover:to-purple-500/30">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-indigo-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 3c-1.5 0-3 .5-4 1.5S6.5 7 6.5 9c0 2.5 1 4.5 2.5 5.5V17c0 .6.4 1 1 1h4c.6 0 1-.4 1-1v-2.5c1.5-1 2.5-3 2.5-5.5 0-2-1-3.5-2-5S13.5 3 12 3z" />
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 21h6" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 text-white">Memoria Persistente</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Recuerda lo que te gusta y lo que no. Cada vez que chateas, el sistema aprende más sobre tus gustos.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative bg-gray-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-purple-500/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-purple-500/5">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-purple-500/20 to-pink-500/20 border border-purple-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:from-purple-500/30 group-hover:to-pink-500/30">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M4 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM14 6a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2V6zM4 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2H6a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2zM14 16a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v2a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2v-2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 text-white">Multi-Categoría</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Videojuegos, películas, series, K-dramas y anime. Todo en un solo lugar, con recomendaciones específicas por categoría.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative bg-gray-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-pink-500/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-pink-500/5">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-500/20 to-rose-500/20 border border-pink-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:from-pink-500/30 group-hover:to-rose-500/30">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-pink-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8 12h.01M12 12h.01M16 12h.01M21 12c0 4.418-4.03 8-9 8a9.863 9.863 0 01-4.255-.949L3 20l1.395-3.72C3.512 15.042 3 13.574 3 12c0-4.418 4.03-8 9-8s9 3.582 9 8z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 text-white">Chat Natural</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Habla como con un amigo. "Recomiéndame algo como Disgaea pero más oscuro" y KnowYou entiende.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative bg-gray-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-amber-500/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-amber-500/5">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-500/20 to-yellow-500/20 border border-amber-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:from-amber-500/30 group-hover:to-yellow-500/30">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 2l3.09 6.26L22 9.27l-5 4.87 1.18 6.88L12 17.77l-6.18 3.25L7 14.14 2 9.27l6.91-1.01L12 2z" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 text-white">Valoración Continua</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Dale like o dislike a cada recomendación. Con el tiempo, las sugerencias se vuelven más precisas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative bg-gray-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-emerald-500/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-emerald-500/5">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-500/20 to-teal-500/20 border border-emerald-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:from-emerald-500/30 group-hover:to-teal-500/30">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-emerald-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6V4m0 2a2 2 0 100 4m0-4a2 2 0 110 4m-6 8a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4m6 6v10m6-2a2 2 0 100-4m0 4a2 2 0 110-4m0 4v2m0-6V4" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 text-white">Filtros Inteligentes</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Filtra por género, plataforma, director, estudios... Encuentra exactamente lo que buscas.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="group relative bg-gray-900/50 backdrop-blur-sm border border-gray-800 rounded-2xl p-8 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-sky-500/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-sky-500/5">
        <div class="w-12 h-12 rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-500/20 to-cyan-500/20 border border-sky-500/10 flex items-center justify-center mb-5 transition-all duration-300 group-hover:scale-110 group-hover:from-sky-500/30 group-hover:to-cyan-500/30">
          <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-sky-400" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M10.5 1.5H8.25A2.25 2.25 0 006 3.75v16.5a2.25 2.25 0 002.25 2.25h7.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 20.25V3.75a2.25 2.25 0 00-2.25-2.25H13.5m-3 0V3h3V1.5m-3 0h3m-3 18.75h3" />
          </svg>
        </div>
        <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold mb-3 text-white">Modo Offline</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
          Tu perfil se guarda localmente. Consulta tus recomendaciones favoritas sin conexión a internet.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
